{"id":618,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"For some reason, this Pokémon smiles slightly when it emits a strong electric current from the yellow markings on its body."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Thanks to bacteria that lived in the mud flats with it, this Pokémon developed the organs it uses to generate electricity."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"When its opponent can’t be paralyzed, it contorts itself with unexpected speed and flops away."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Static","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is charged with static electricity and may paralyze attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Limber","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's limber body prevents it from being paralyzed."},{"name":"Sand Veil","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in a sandstorm."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":618,"name":"Stunfisk","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,55],[1,84],[1,189],[5,203],[10,341],[15,279],[20,268],[25,389],[30,604],[35,340],[40,330],[45,435],[50,175],[55,90]],"machine":[213,340,523,91,414,89,598,604,527,203,263,492,341,330,371,182,240,156,279,157,317,496,201,503,214,188,482,173,446,707,444,164,57,87,86,85,253],"egg":[310,174,220,513,209,180,281],"tutor":[808]},"cards":[{"id":"rsv10pt5-118","name":"Stunfisk","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"118","artist":"Toshinao Aoki","img":"rsv10pt5/118"},{"id":"me2pt5-62","name":"Stunfisk","set":"As